{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras/f92cbda262d4b03e746ad010c4f0bfa3.avif?t=1763763401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras_big/f92cbda262d4b03e746ad010c4f0bfa3.avif?t=1763763401 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play as a mercenary</strong> hired on Halloween to kill the Devil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>2D Roguelike shooter</strong> game where you <strong>MUST kill monsters</strong> <strong>to stay alive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you overcome the haunted mansion and complete your mission in a few <strong>Deadly Seconds</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras/bf17a6cd7fb6d60b556cf85a18338a82.avif?t=1763763401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras_big/bf17a6cd7fb6d60b556cf85a18338a82.avif?t=1763763401 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play as the Red Merc and enter the haunted mansion to stop the Devil's ritual. But don't let the Deadly Seconds reach zero or the Grim Reaper will get you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout your mission there will be <strong>multiple weapons and items</strong> which can be used to deal with <strong>enemies and environmental pieces</strong> in different ways. Furthermore all weapons and items have <strong>side effects based on their colors</strong>, which can grant you an even <strong>bigger advantage</strong> if used correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Due to your unfortunate circumstances, you'll have to kill monsters in order to stay alive and <strong>complete your mission</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alongside that, <strong>finishing off monsters with</strong> <strong><i>style</i></strong> will give you more points than they're worth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go through <strong>various randomly selected rooms</strong> with a handcrafted layout and <strong>NO</strong> way back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you feel creative, <strong>edit the rooms and create new ones</strong> for your own entertainment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras/e91b489521c4ba8414fa0a8bf293fc1e.avif?t=1763763401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras_big/e91b489521c4ba8414fa0a8bf293fc1e.avif?t=1763763401 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Set highscores and get the best ranks on every run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your points turn into <strong>MONEY</strong> which can be used at the <strong>shop to buy upgrades</strong> for future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Finish your mission with the <strong>fastest and most efficient scores</strong> to get that <i><strong>sweet</strong></i><strong> S rank!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023330?t=1763763401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/d9adbcafb70b34af717d3e95660d95158cb3236c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763763401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/05c09f26d7b55f915ae403fb6f0a91cc007c7d91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763763401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/05c09f26d7b55f915ae403fb6f0a91cc007c7d91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763763401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent depictions of cartoon violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras/f92cbda262d4b03e746ad010c4f0bfa3.avif?t=1763763401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras_big/f92cbda262d4b03e746ad010c4f0bfa3.avif?t=1763763401 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play as a mercenary</strong> hired on Halloween to kill the Devil!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A <strong>2D Roguelike shooter</strong> game where you <strong>MUST kill monsters</strong> <strong>to stay alive!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you overcome the haunted mansion and complete your mission in a few <strong>Deadly Seconds</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras/bf17a6cd7fb6d60b556cf85a18338a82.avif?t=1763763401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras_big/bf17a6cd7fb6d60b556cf85a18338a82.avif?t=1763763401 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Play as the Red Merc and enter the haunted mansion to stop the Devil's ritual. But don't let the Deadly Seconds reach zero or the Grim Reaper will get you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Throughout your mission there will be <strong>multiple weapons and items</strong> which can be used to deal with <strong>enemies and environmental pieces</strong> in different ways. Furthermore all weapons and items have <strong>side effects based on their colors</strong>, which can grant you an even <strong>bigger advantage</strong> if used correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Due to your unfortunate circumstances, you'll have to kill monsters in order to stay alive and <strong>complete your mission</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Alongside that, <strong>finishing off monsters with</strong> <strong><i>style</i></strong> will give you more points than they're worth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go through <strong>various randomly selected rooms</strong> with a handcrafted layout and <strong>NO</strong> way back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you feel creative, <strong>edit the rooms and create new ones</strong> for your own entertainment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras/e91b489521c4ba8414fa0a8bf293fc1e.avif?t=1763763401\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/extras_big/e91b489521c4ba8414fa0a8bf293fc1e.avif?t=1763763401 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Set highscores and get the best ranks on every run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your points turn into <strong>MONEY</strong> which can be used at the <strong>shop to buy upgrades</strong> for future runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Finish your mission with the <strong>fastest and most efficient scores</strong> to get that <i><strong>sweet</strong></i><strong> S rank!</strong></p>","developers":["Fox_gamerPT"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023330/6e43dd927e74dfe2863e05e0143c3645bfc30a4c/header.jpg?t=1763763401","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Fern\u00e3o Marques Franco. All rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023330/1273315516/ed6eedeecd29f92c92377356d3e785ad991b66f2/1763761558/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763763400","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023330/1273315516/ed6eedeecd29f92c92377356d3e785ad991b66f2/1763761558/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763763400","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4023330/1273315516/ed6eedeecd29f92c92377356d3e785ad991b66f2/1763761558/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763763400","id":257236100,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257236100/49767260ed1f49dd0086a997b376aa7b68f31446/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763763400"}],"name":"Deadly Seconds","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8565U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) UHD Graphics 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 31 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true